      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.31,
          "end": 4.44,
          "en": "-: Time to take another look at directives,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.44,
          "end": 7.53,
          "en": "and not only repeat quickly what we learned thus far,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.53,
          "end": 10.89,
          "en": "but also learn how to build our own directives.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.89,
          "end": 12.3,
          "en": "And then we dive into the difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.3,
          "end": 14.55,
          "en": "between attribute and structural directives,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.55,
          "end": 18.48,
          "en": "and what this star means on the structural directives.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.48,
          "end": 20.16,
          "en": "Well, I already said it, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.16,
          "end": 23.46,
          "en": "We got attribute and structural directives.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.46,
          "end": 25.74,
          "en": "Attribute directives are called like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.74,
          "end": 29.97,
          "en": "because they sit on elements, Just like attributes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.97,
          "end": 32.82,
          "en": "and structural directives basically do the same,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.82,
          "end": 35.25,
          "en": "but they also change the structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.25,
          "end": 37.2,
          "en": "of the DOM around this element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.2,
          "end": 41.97,
          "en": "If you have NGF on a paragraph, if that condition is false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.97,
          "end": 44.37,
          "en": "this paragraph is removed from the DOM,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.37,
          "end": 47.13,
          "en": "so the overall view container is affected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.13,
          "end": 48.99,
          "en": "whereas on the attribute directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.99,
          "end": 51.81,
          "en": "you never destroy an element from the DOM,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.81,
          "end": 54.21,
          "en": "you only change properties of that element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.21,
          "end": 56.55,
          "en": "for example, the background color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.55,
          "end": 59.01,
          "en": "So, that is why we have attribute directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.01,
          "end": 61.38,
          "en": "only affecting the element they sit on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.38,
          "end": 62.97,
          "en": "and structural directives,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.97,
          "end": 65.76,
          "en": "which also affect the whole DOM or the view container,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.76,
          "end": 69.84,
          "en": "the area around the element which they were placed on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.84,
          "end": 71.19,
          "en": "That is the difference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.19,
          "end": 74.4,
          "en": "Now, let's briefly have a look at the directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.4,
          "end": 76.56,
          "en": "we already know and how to use them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 76.56,
          "end": 78.75,
          "en": "before we then dive into building our own ones,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.75,
          "end": 81.213,
          "en": "and learn more about structural directives.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
